    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kukangana kwa Yelemiya ni Pasha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pandaŵi jele Pasha jwaliji jwakutaga mbopesi soni mwanace jwa Imeli jwele juŵaliji kapitawo jwamkulungwa ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " piŵampikene Yelemiya ali mkulocesya yindu yeleyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jwalakwejo ŵalamwile ŵandu kuti ampute Yelemiya ni kumwugalila ku nyumba ja akayidi jijaliji ku Cipata ca Benjamini, ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kundaŵi kwakwe, Pasha ŵamkopwesye Yelemiya m'nyumba ja akayidi jila, nipo Yelemiya ŵamsalile Pasha kuti, “AMBUJE ngamkolanga soni lina lyakuti Pasha, nambo lyakuti ‘Yakogoya ku mbali syosope.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE akuŵeceta kuti, ‘Tinjimtenda m'mwejo kuŵa cakogoya kwa m'mwejo mwasyene ni kwa acimjenu, nipo m'mwejo timcawona jemanjajo ali mkuwulajidwa ni amagongo ŵawo pakukamulisya masengo mawupanga, m'mwejo mli mkulola. Ŵandu wosope ku Yuda tinjapeleka myala mwa mwenye jwa ku Babiloniya, jutacajigala ŵane mwa jemanjajo ukapolo kuja nawo ku Babiloniya, nipo ŵane tacawulaga ni upanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cipanje cosope ca mu msindamu, yakupata yosope kutyocela ku masengo gawo, yindu yosope yamtengo wapenani ni yipanje ya ayimwene ŵa ku Yuda tinjiyipeleka kwa amagongo ŵawo, utaciyijigala yosopeyi ni kuja nayo ku Babiloniya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo, m'mwe Pasha ni wosope ŵa mwiŵasa mwenu, timcijigalidwa kuja ku ukapolo ku Babiloniya. Timciwila ni kusicidwa kukoko, m'mwejo pamo ni acimjenu umwasalilaga ya unami ŵala.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yelemiya akudandawula kwa AMBUJE",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
